return [
    ['q' => 'Can anyone buy property in Morni Hills?', 'a' => 'Residential and commercial plots in Morni can be bought by any Indian citizen, from any state. This is the practical difference from Kasauli or Solan, where Himachal restricts buyers from outside the state. Agricultural land depends on the classification in the revenue record.'],
    ['q' => 'How much does property in Morni Hills cost?', 'a' => 'There is no single rate. The approach road matters far more than the view, and two plots a hundred metres apart can differ several times over. Call with the khasra number and we will tell you what similar land nearby actually sold for.'],
